   "summary": "Kimsuky, a North Korean threat group, is integrating local large language models \u2014 including Ollama, GPT4All, and Msty \u2014 into its operations to generate decoy documents and improve phishing tactics. The activity, linked to the ongoing \"Operation GitPower\" and the earlier \"FlowerPower\" campaign, uses GitHub-based infrastructure and LNK files to deliver AsyncRAT malware. Reported targeting focuses on government, defense, finance, and foreign diplomatic missions."
  },
